  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0001_e84e0fa97151.png\"><br>\r\nBoth the structures are impossible as $\\mathrm{N}^{\\circ}$ is pentavalent and we known that $\\mathrm{N}$ can not expand its valency beyond 4 due to absence of vacant d-orbitals in its valence shell."
